CAT-AD Anonymous Review Artifact Use Statement

This artifact is provided for anonymous peer review and artifact evaluation of
the CAT-AD submission.

Permitted review uses:

- inspect the manuscript source, code, generated tables, figures, manifests,
  and local preview PDF;
- run the documented no-download verification commands;
- reproduce the archived benchmark checks on a local review machine; and
- retain local copies as needed for confidential review and artifact-evaluation
  processes.

Restrictions during anonymous review:

- do not redistribute the artifact publicly;
- do not use the attack code against live aviation systems, receivers,
  aircraft, or operational infrastructure;
- do not use the artifact to deanonymize the authors; and
- do not present this anonymous review artifact as an accepted, camera-ready,
  certified-safe, or officially badged release.

Public release license:

This anonymous review statement is not a public open-source license. A public
release license, if any, should be selected by the authors for the
deanonymized/camera-ready artifact.
